## 23. TEMPORARY THRESHOLD EXCEPTIONS
================================================================================

### 23.1 When Exceptions Are Allowed

Temporary threshold reductions are ONLY allowed during:
- Initial service creation (first sprint)
- Major refactoring (with JIRA ticket)
- Legacy code migration

### 23.2 Exception Process

1. **Document in pom.xml:**
   ```xml
   <!-- TODO: Increase to 0.80/0.75 by JIRA-XXX -->
   <minimum>0.50</minimum>
   ```

2. **Create tracking ticket** with:
   - Current coverage
   - Target coverage
   - Timeline to reach target

3. **Maximum duration:** 2 sprints

4. **Review requirement:** Tech lead approval

### 23.3 Current Exceptions

| Service | Line Coverage | Branch Coverage | JIRA | Target Date |
|---------|---------------|-----------------|------|-------------|
| order-service | 0.50 | 0.00 | TBD | TBD |
| user-service | 0.50 | 0.04 | TBD | TBD |

**Goal:** All services at 80%/75% coverage by Q1 2025.

